	(gr_text ".                                                       .\n JP2 - zero WS ISA (Default - Close)\n JP4 - ROM section select\n JP5 - use IRQ2 (Default - Open)\n JP6/7 - DDC support (default - DDC2B)\n  DDC2B - JP6/7 and R27-R30 must be installed,\n  DDC1  - R26, R28 and R30 must be installed.\n \n R39-R41 - configuration resistors:\n R39 - 50 MHz MCLK default (on)\n R40 - 7/6 MCLK Extended RAS timing (np)\n R41 - Multiple CAS DRAMs (on)\n R42 - 3C3/46E8H Sleep Address (np)\n default - set R39 and R41\n.                                                       .\n"
